{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:7YubiKit8WebAuthnO9ExtensionO3PRFV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PRF","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PRF","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}],"title":"WebAuthn.Extension.PRF","symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","extendedModule":"YubiKit"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Registration","anchor":"Registration","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/PRF\/Registration","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/RegistrationInputs\/prf"]},{"title":"Authentication","anchor":"Authentication","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/PRF\/Authentication","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/AuthenticationInputs\/prf"]},{"title":"Direct CTAP2 Use","anchor":"Direct-CTAP2-Use","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/PRF\/init(session:)","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/PRF\/init(first:second:evalByCredential:session:)","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/PRF\/init(evalByCredential:session:)","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/PRF\/makeCredential","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/PRF\/getAssertion","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/PRF\/MakeCredentialOperations","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/PRF\/GetAssertionOperations"]},{"title":"Supporting Types","anchor":"Supporting-Types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/PRF\/Eval","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/PRF\/